#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:1
msgid "制作人于灵的介绍"
msgstr "Introduction to Producer Yu Ling"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:4
msgid "于灵"
msgstr "Yu Ling"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:12
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;28岁，云南临沧傣族，⼥性，居住在江西新余市，从事⾦融⾏业转游戏⾏业，喜欢做⼀个以电⼦游戏为载体的故事讲述者。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;28 years old, Dai ethnicity from Lincang, Yunnan, female, residing in Xinyu City, Jiangxi Province. Transitioned from the finance industry to the game industry, enjoys being a storyteller using video games as a medium."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:14
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;计算机专业毕业。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Graduated with a Computer Science degree."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:16
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;喜欢玩魔方，有点拖延症，喜欢玩动作和FPS类游戏（人菜瘾大）。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Enjoys solving Rubik's cubes, has a bit of procrastination habit, likes playing action and FPS games (not very skilled but highly addicted)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:18
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;日常偶尔会中二病，虽然是一个成熟职场女性（曾经），但在闲暇时喜欢发散自己的想象力。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Occasionally has chuunibyou (eighth-grader syndrome) tendencies in daily life. Though a mature professional woman (formerly), she enjoys letting her imagination run wild in her free time."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:20
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;在生活中的一些节日和生日中很有仪式感，理性又浪漫主义。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Has a strong sense of ceremony for holidays and birthdays in life, both rational and romantic."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:22
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;养了一只暹罗猫叫大狮，对塔罗牌有灵性。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Has a Siamese cat named Dash (Big Lion), has an intuitive connection with tarot cards."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:24
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;有神秘身份，对《灵数奇缘》有特别的情感。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Has a mysterious identity, holds special feelings toward \"Luv Sense Digital\"."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:26
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;通常形象是微卷中短发，穿有民族元素（刺绣）的简洁的日常服装。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Typical appearance features slightly wavy medium-short hair, wearing simple daily clothing with ethnic elements (embroidery)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/v-producer.md:28
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;眼神比较温柔坚定又有童真（仍然有光）。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Eyes are gentle yet determined with childlike innocence (still shining with light)."
